    "description": {
      "value": "These cartridges are filled with sticky clear glue. When a glue bullet hits, a syrupy webbing coats the target and sticks to the ground or a nearby surface, hindering their movement. The target takes a \u201310-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds for 2d4 rounds, or until it Escapes against a DC of 18. On a critical hit, the target is also immobilized until it Escapes."
